WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.434
The Tennessee

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.435
State House

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:06.306
they have just voted to expel.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.776
State Representative Justin Jones

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.546
this is because of a disorderly protest

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.748
that he and two other

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:17.417
Democratic colleagues held

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.755
last week in the wake of the shootings

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.492
in Memphis, Tennessee.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.627
Six people died.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:28.595
There were a lot of people

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.431
who are very angry about

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.099
those six murders.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.768
They could have converged,

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.469
converged on the Capitol.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.704
Three of those state

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.473
representatives, three Democrats

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.242
Justin Jones, Justin Pearson

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:44.010
and Gloria Johnson

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.178
were disruptive

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.980
on the floor of the state House.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.449
One of the three has now been expelled

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.451
from the state House.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.186
And the other votes on the other

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.488
two will happen imminently.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.690
Let's go to Ryan Young.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:01.461
Ryan, they did it I have to say, I've it

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:04.964
seems like a rather harsh punishment for

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:06.266
for being unruly on

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:07.233
the floor of the state House.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.802
But when you have a supermajority

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:10.170
you know,

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.972
your party can do whatever it wants.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.707
Absolutely.

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:14.941
Jake,

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.543
I'm not surprised by this based upon

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.410
what Democrats

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.778
have been telling us all day long,

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.713
they believe this vote would happen.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:21.781
In fact, we've learned

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.150
there are plans for all three members

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.385
to walk outside

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.453
and do a news conference

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.921
after they're expelled.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.089
We do believe

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.391
Justin Jones will also be escorted

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.159
from inside the chambers

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.328
after this procedure happens.

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.831
There's hope that he's allowed

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:38.798
to go to his office

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.433
to clear it out himself.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:41.835
But there's also a belief

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.735
that he may be walked

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:43.503
directly out

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.004
and not even get a chance

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.107
to pack up his own items.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.408
This is shocking to so many people

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.110
because obviously the focus now,

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.878
especially a lot of the media focus

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.680
is on this going on

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.815
and not the six lives that were lost

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.050
just last week.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.518
And even the heroic

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.752
officers who went in

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.321
to neutralize the threat.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.123
So now you could hear those protesters

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.591
screaming in the background.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.959
We thought this would happen.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:06.793
We're also told

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:07.427
more people

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.862
might be swelling into the area

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:10.897
because they want to participate

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:11.631
in the rally

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:12.899
that's going to be held here.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.068
After all, these proceedings are done.

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:15.835
But, Jake,

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:16.603
this is quite a shock

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:17.537
when you think about the fact

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.572
that no one has ever been expelled

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.041
for a procedural matter.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.576
This comes down to decorum

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.178
and the decorum wasn't followed.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:26.079
Giving the Republicans

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.780
a chance to pull this off.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.482
And like you've noted earlier,

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.984
these members will have a chance

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.285
to run for their seat again.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:34.754
So we might be back in the same situation

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:35.989
with these same members

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.223
back here in a few months

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.324
after they probably

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.359
will get expelled today.

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:42.495
So there was a motion to adjourn,

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.197
but that has been defeated.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.131
And they are now

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:46.266
the Tennessee State House

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:49.836
after expelling Representative

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:52.205
Justin Jones, who you saw there

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.274
in the ABC there in the white suit.

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.110
He was holding up a fist a second ago.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.378
They are now proceeding to House

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:00.046
Resolution 64

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.481
to expel State Representative

00:03:01.481 --> 00:03:02.849
Gloria Johnson.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:04.284
There

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:04.817
you see

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:05.118
a state

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:06.052
representative, former

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.353
I should say, ex

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.088
state representative Jones

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.291
speaking to reporters there.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:15.628
And Ryan Young, it is shocking,

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:17.597
as you know,

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:21.301
the idea that what has motivated

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:24.971
a state legislative body in Tennessee

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:26.072
a week

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:27.640
after this horrible attack

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.776
on a Christian school

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:32.345
where a disturbed person

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:35.582
entered with guns, killed 39 year olds

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:36.382
and killed

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.819
three faculty and staff members before

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.087
police officers.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.689
Law enforcement from the Memphis area

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.490
bravely charged in

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.327
and and killed the killed the shooter.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:50.897
So that what is actually prompted action

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:54.067
is the fact that three state House

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:56.369
Democrats were unruly

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:59.839
on the floor of the state House.

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:00.940
And, look, obviously,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.041
they violated the rules.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:02.575
Obviously,

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:04.877
they were disruptive and unruly.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:05.645
And I'm not saying

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:06.713
