00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.047
but it is just

00:04:08.047 --> 00:04:08.948
stark you see,

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.483
I believe that that that is Gloria

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:12.318
Johnson there on the left.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.987
State Representative Gloria Johnson,

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:14.587
a Democrat.

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:17.690
The action that they are taking right now

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.526
