That is not prompting

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:07.440
the state legislature to act.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.375
It is these requirements.

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:10.643
These state representatives,

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:12.545
these three Democrats, are being rude.

00:05:12.545 --> 00:05:14.580
I mean, that is not

00:05:15.682 --> 00:05:16.449
unusual.

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.785
I would think that well,

