00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.191
how to protect the students

00:05:25.191 --> 00:05:26.626
and faculty members.

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.462
Yeah, let's

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:30.396
first things first, Jake,

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:31.831
when you think about it, Jones's

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:32.632
