00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.505
we stand together as I'm talking about

00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:34.173
the need to go support them.

00:09:34.173 --> 00:09:35.308
You know, I can't be on the House floor

00:09:35.308 --> 00:09:36.008
right now.

00:09:36.008 --> 00:09:37.009
I'm going to go to the galleries

00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:38.911
and stay for the hearing

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:40.813
because we are in this together.

00:09:40.813 --> 00:09:42.448
And it's not one that we represent

00:09:42.448 --> 00:09:43.449
you know, we're multi-racial

00:09:43.449 --> 00:09:44.483
as a generational.

00:09:44.483 --> 00:09:45.418
We represent Memphis,

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:46.619
Nashville, Knoxville.

00:09:46.619 --> 00:09:47.420
We stand united.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.087
And the people across

00:09:48.087 --> 00:09:49.422
the nation are paying attention

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:50.056
to what's happening

00:09:50.056 --> 00:09:51.490
because this is not in the air.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.492
But what they did was signal that that

00:09:53.993 --> 00:09:54.727
if we don't act,

00:09:54.727 --> 00:09:56.495
we knew we would lose out on

00:09:56.495 --> 00:09:58.164
Saturday was a signal that we have left

00:09:58.164 --> 00:09:59.398
a lot of things in Tennessee

00:09:59.398 --> 00:10:00.199
and that we are

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:03.302
on the path toward authoritarianism.

00:10:03.302 --> 00:10:05.137
But on where you were to, again,

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:06.405
I have no idea.

00:10:06.405 --> 00:10:06.606
You know,

00:10:06.606 --> 00:10:08.040
what are my next steps in terms

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.942
of responding to this extreme measure?

00:10:09.942 --> 00:10:11.143
But I will continue to show up

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:13.412
for the people who continue to talk to,

00:10:13.412 --> 00:10:14.981
you know, to demand action on common

00:10:14.981 --> 00:10:15.948
sense gun laws,

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:17.516
because what we were saying was, let's

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:18.951
let us pass an assault weapons ban.

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:19.885
Let's take action.

00:10:19.885 --> 00:10:20.486
And they responded

00:10:20.486 --> 00:10:21.887
by assaulting democracy

00:10:21.887 --> 00:10:23.089
So thank you all so much.

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:24.390
Thank you, Representative Jones.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.758
I don't have any next steps,

00:10:25.758 --> 00:10:26.659
but I will continue to show up

00:10:26.659 --> 00:10:28.027
in this Capitol with these young people

00:10:28.027 --> 00:10:29.895
and whether I'm in that chamber outside.

00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:31.130
And so we don't know what's next.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.598
I'm going to consult my legal team

00:10:32.598 --> 00:10:33.165
because I believe that

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:35.134
what they did was unconstitutional.

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:36.836
I believe that it violated,

00:10:36.836 --> 00:10:38.504
you know, many of our rights.

00:10:38.504 --> 00:10:40.206
And so at the silence

00:10:40.206 --> 00:10:41.907
walk, rather than just me, my district.

00:10:41.907 --> 00:10:44.110
78,000 people have lost their

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:45.478
their vote and their voice

00:10:45.478 --> 00:10:46.512
because of the extreme actions

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:47.380
of this body.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.614
So I'll continue to show up

00:10:48.614 --> 00:10:49.515
